ers/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-08-06T17:21:30Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T14:58:36Z","closed_at":"2025-08-11T14:58:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5-dev4 and newer versions (4.5-beta5 released today 6 August, still has this bug)\n- Not reproducible in:  4.5-dev3 and older versions\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA T1200 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7324) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-11950H @ 2.60GHz (16 threads) - 63.67 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen loading a scene that contains a bone attachment that comes before an external skeleton, the global transform of the bone attachment will be based on the global transform of the external skeleton before it is inside the tree, as it comes first on the tree, and it will cause this error message:\n\n<img width=\"1918\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a6e717-b563-4685-95dc-9385d7444b62\" />\n\n\nBelow is a screenshot from a project that contains multiple instances of a scene that has the same setup of the MRP:\n\n<img width=\"1251\" height=\"971\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ac90f70-5a76-4211-add4-409e58a4e84a\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHave a scene with a `BoneAttachment3D`\nDefine an external `Skeleton3D` for it.\nMake sure the bone attachment comes before the skeleton\nReload the scene\n\nor\n\nJust open the MRP project\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[InsideTreeBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21625841/InsideTreeBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109366/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}